<h2 id="the-7-pte-essay-topic-categories-and-which-repeat-most"><b>The 7 PTE Essay Topic Categories (and Which Repeat Most)</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pearson consistently draws from the same pool of subject areas. Below are the seven categories, ranked by how frequently they appear in the exam. The topics in the full list are organised within these categories.</span></p>
