<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Each answer below uses the 4-paragraph template and targets a 79+ score. Study the structure, the connective language, and the vocabulary choices not just the content. The goal is to internalise the pattern, not memorise the answer.</span></p>
<p><b>Model Answer 1 &#8211; Education (Topic 1)</b></p>
<table>
